    { "Willo keeps a second brain", "ask her to remember something, add it to your list, remind you at a town, level or time, pin a spot or keep a goal like \"my mount at 40\", and she writes it down in the new Notebook tab and speaks up right when it matters. See everything she keeps about you in one place, change it or erase any of it.", "Willo keeps a second brain:" },
